  "notes": {
    "title": "Combat movement hotfix",
    "summary": "Fixed a combat stall where enemies and your heroine could wait for each other instead of attacking.",
    "changes": [
      "Enemies now finish approaching their targets before stopping, including when resuming an existing run.",
      "Season 1 now shows a one-time explanation of what was kept and reset. Already updated profiles get the notice too; your current run and Season 1 progress stay intact."
    ]
